{"seq":1,"slug":"shock-therapy-and-economy","title":"休克疗法与经济转型的代价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/boris-yeltsin/yeltsin-legacy/domestic-transformation/shock-therapy-and-economy","wordCount":1817,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"休克疗法与经济转型的代价\">休克疗法与经济转型的代价</h1><p>1992年1月2日清晨，俄罗斯绝大多数商品的价格管制被一次性取消。这一天后来被反复引用，成为&quot;休克疗法&quot;的象征性起点。主导这场实验的是35岁的代总理叶戈尔·盖达尔(Yegor Gaidar)和负责私有化的阿纳托利·丘拜斯(Anatoly Chubais)。他们的判断是:苏联式的计划体制已经死亡，任何渐进式修补都只会延长痛苦，唯一出路是用最快的速度建立市场价格、硬化预算约束、让卢布自由兑换。叶利钦把自己的政治威望全部押在了这个方案上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-什么是休克疗法\">核心概念:什么是休克疗法</h2><p>&quot;休克疗法&quot;(shock therapy)指的是一揽子同时推进、节奏极快的市场化改革，与之相对的是&quot;渐进主义&quot;(gradualism)。它通常包含三根支柱:价格自由化(取消政府定价)、稳定化(削减财政赤字、收紧货币以压制通胀)、私有化(把国有企业转为私人所有)。其理论依据来自波兰1990年的&quot;巴尔采罗维奇计划&quot;,以及杰弗里·萨克斯等西方经济学家的建议——他们认为腐烂的旧体制不可能&quot;半怀孕&quot;,必须一次性跨越制度的鸿沟。</p>\n<p>下图勾勒了俄罗斯版休克疗法的政策逻辑链条:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[计划经济瘫痪/物资短缺] --&gt; B[价格自由化 1992-01]&#10;    B --&gt; C[市场价格信号恢复]&#10;    B --&gt; D[恶性通胀爆发]&#10;    A --&gt; E[财政货币稳定化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[预算硬约束]&#10;    A --&gt; G[大规模私有化]&#10;    G --&gt; H[企业转为私有]&#10;    D --&gt; I[储蓄蒸发/民生恶化]&#10;    H --&gt; J[寡头崛起]\">flowchart TD\n    A[计划经济瘫痪/物资短缺] --&gt; B[价格自由化 1992-01]\n    B --&gt; C[市场价格信号恢复]\n    B --&gt; D[恶性通胀爆发]\n    A --&gt; E[财政货币稳定化]\n    E --&gt; F[预算硬约束]\n    A --&gt; G[大规模私有化]\n    G --&gt; H[企业转为私有]\n    D --&gt; I[储蓄蒸发/民生恶化]\n    H --&gt; J[寡头崛起]</pre><p>不同改革路径的设想结果与现实对照如下:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>渐进主义设想</th>\n<th>休克疗法设想</th>\n<th>俄罗斯现实(1992—1998)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格放开</td>\n<td>分步、有序</td>\n<td>一次性放开</td>\n<td>一次性放开，通胀失控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通胀</td>\n<td>温和可控</td>\n<td>短期高、迅速回落</td>\n<td>1992年约2500%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产出</td>\n<td>缓降</td>\n<td>V型反弹</td>\n<td>连续多年萎缩，无V型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有化</td>\n<td>谨慎透明</td>\n<td>快速广覆盖</td>\n<td>快速但极不透明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社会结构</td>\n<td>培育中产</td>\n<td>培育中产</td>\n<td>两极分化，寡头与赤贫并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价格自由化的即时冲击\">价格自由化的即时冲击</h2><p>放开价格的当月，物价就上涨了约300%;头三个月累计涨幅高达约1000%。到1992年全年，通货膨胀率达到约2500%的恶性水平。对普通家庭而言，这意味着苏联时期积攒下来的银行储蓄在几个月内被通胀彻底吞没——一代人的积蓄化为乌有。货架确实从空荡变得充实，但绝大多数人买不起。</p>\n<p>设<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>为放开前的价格水平、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>为年通胀率，则一年后实际购买力按</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1 = P_0 \\times (1 + \\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>计算，当<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi \\approx 25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span>(即2500%)时，名义价格膨胀约26倍，而工资与储蓄的调整远远滞后于此，实际购买力因而急剧塌缩。这正是1992至1994年间消费者购买力被严重侵蚀的数学写照，直到1995—1996年政府以紧缩货币政策才把通胀压下来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"产出崩溃与-转型萧条\">产出崩溃与&quot;转型萧条&quot;</h2><p>休克疗法的设计者预期产出会先降后升，呈V型反弹。现实却是持续多年的&quot;转型萧条&quot;:工业生产、GDP连年下滑,1990年代俄罗斯经济累计萎缩幅度之大，在和平时期的工业国中极为罕见。原因是多重的——旧的供应链与计划订单瞬间断裂，新的市场机制尚未建立;企业失去软预算补贴却又缺乏真正的破产清算;资本外逃、投资枯竭。改革派把困境归咎于改革不彻底、议会掣肘;批评者则认为正是&quot;一夜放开、配套缺失&quot;的设计本身埋下了崩溃的种子。</p>\n<p>衡量这场萧条深度，可用产出指数的逐年连乘来近似。设<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>为第<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>年的实际增长率，则相对1990年的累计产出水平为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_n = \\prod_{t=1}^{n} (1 + y_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当连续多年<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>为显著负值时,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>会跌至远低于1的水平。俄罗斯在1990年代多数年份增长率为负，累计萎缩幅度在和平时期工业国中极为少见，这一连乘塌缩正是&quot;转型萧条&quot;的量化表达。雪上加霜的是1998年8月的金融危机:政府对国内债务违约、卢布大幅贬值，刚刚企稳的经济再遭重创，也让许多俄罗斯人对市场化改革本身彻底失去信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盖达尔的政治代价\">盖达尔的政治代价</h2><p>经济阵痛迅速转化为政治压力。盖达尔成为民众不满的焦点，昔日盟友纷纷倒戈，复苏中的共产党借机施压要求修正改革方法。1992年底，在经济持续恶化与同议会激烈冲突的双重夹击下，叶利钦被迫解除盖达尔的代总理职务，改由维克托·切尔诺梅尔金(Viktor Chernomyrdin)接任。这一人事更替标志着最激进的改革阶段告一段落，也预示了行政权与立法权之间矛盾的进一步激化——这正是1993年宪政危机的前奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评价的两极\">评价的两极</h2><p>围绕休克疗法的评价至今高度分裂。辩护方(包括盖达尔、丘拜斯本人及部分西方经济学家)主张:旧体制已无可挽救，延误只会更糟;市场和私有产权一旦建立便不可逆,1999年后的复苏正得益于此。批评方(从俄共到约瑟夫·斯蒂格利茨等经济学家)则指出:缺乏法治、监管与社会保障配套的&quot;一刀切&quot;放开，制造了恶性通胀、产出崩溃、空前的不平等，并直接孕育了寡头阶层，为日后的威权回潮铺平了道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>1992年1月2日的价格放开是俄罗斯休克疗法的起点，主导者为盖达尔与丘拜斯，叶利钦提供政治背书。</li>\n<li>即时后果是恶性通胀(1992年约2500%)与全民储蓄蒸发，货架充实但购买力崩塌。</li>\n<li>产出未现预期的V型反弹，而是陷入多年&quot;转型萧条&quot;。</li>\n<li>政治代价是盖达尔1992年底去职，改革进入与议会对抗的阶段。</li>\n<li>历史评价两极分化:或视为不可避免的阵痛，或视为设计失当、催生寡头的灾难——这一争论构成叶利钦经济遗产的核心。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"oligarchs-and-privatization\">私有化、寡头与1996年大选</a>——休克疗法的第三根支柱「私有化」在本篇只点到为止，那里完整展开凭证私有化与贷款换股份如何催生寡头阶层。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"constitution-and-presidency\">1993年宪政危机与超级总统制</a>——本篇末尾盖达尔去职、改革与议会对抗，正是次年宪政危机的前奏，那里接续这条政治线索。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../../economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/inflation-and-price-index\">通货膨胀与价格指数</a>——本篇用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1=P_0(1+\\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 描述 2500% 恶性通胀，这里给出通胀度量与价格指数的系统定义，理解「储蓄蒸发」的量化机制。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../margaret-thatcher/thatcher-thatcherism/policies-in-power/privatisation-and-deregulation\">私有化与放松管制：把国家逐出经济</a>——撒切尔式渐进、透明的私有化与俄罗斯「一夜放开」形成鲜明对照，理解市场化路径选择为何决定后果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"休克疗法与经济转型的代价","id":"休克疗法与经济转型的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:什么是休克疗法","id":"核心概念-什么是休克疗法"},{"level":2,"text":"价格自由化的即时冲击","id":"价格自由化的即时冲击"},{"level":2,"text":"产出崩溃与\"转型萧条\"","id":"产出崩溃与-转型萧条"},{"level":2,"text":"盖达尔的政治代价","id":"盖达尔的政治代价"},{"level":2,"text":"评价的两极","id":"评价的两极"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"1993年宪政危机与超级总统制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/boris-yeltsin/yeltsin-legacy/domestic-transformation/constitution-and-presidency"}}